#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
sync-repos: Intelligent Git Repository Analysis, Commit & Push Tool

Workflow:
  1. Analyzes Git repositories (current repo, specific target, or all user repos).
  2. Inspects working tree changes (untracked, modified, staged, deleted, mode changes).
  3. Synthesizes high-signal, contextual commit messages matching the user's
     conventional commit style (feat:, docs:, config:, fix:, chore:).
  4. Stages all changed files (git add -A).
  5. Commits with synthesized or edited message (with interactive review/editor support).
  6. Safely pulls and pushes changes to their respective remotes.

Author: Antigravity Pair Programmer
"""

